{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:31 2026-11-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:31 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:31 2026-11-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a23d0170a37cd218553cf51f159aa00c/2026-11/2026-11-21_01_23_21.png\"/><p>東北季候風正影響廣東。而預料現時覆蓋廣東沿岸的廣闊雲帶會逐漸遠離該區。</p><p>本港地區今日大致多雲及乾燥。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約20度。吹和緩至清勁偏北風，稍後轉吹東風。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/143b2fd05213630da966bd28c5bbc9d3/2026-11/2026-11-21_01_24_18.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5eca440ee3e2cfabd91486c646e1d918/2026-11/2026-11-21_01_24_26.png\"/><p>展望未來一兩日大致多雲，風勢頗大，氣溫略為回升。下週中期氣溫再度下降。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:43:58.988870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:31:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T03:17:25.713851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:37:21.525271+00:00","content_hash":"93d52d96884aad35693de9302ac01cc4b46503e88a639dd81d97b089d6ffbdfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}